<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Finance (Guernsey) Ltd has issued one million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  750.0	 44.99 FRF	 9.05 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	  780.0	 35.38 FRF	11.51 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT C	   750.0	 20.74 FRF	19.64 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	   780.0	 27.12 FRF	14.69 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-30.JAN.98   PAYDATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $765.00</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
